      "statement": "CachedDocumentLoader wraps load with a TTLCache (maxsize 100, ttl default 300s) keyed on (source or stream bytes, vision_mode), and most concrete loaders additionally decorate their own load with @cachedmethod on the same cache, so the caching mechanism exists twice in the inheritance chain.",
